First, create an object that represents the sample space.
This can be done using the following code:
```
const options = {
  method: 'post',
  uri: 'https://example.com/probability/event',
  jsonPayload: {
    '@context': 'http://schema.org/',
    'space': {
      'sample_space': '/path/to/sample-space'
    },
    'outcomes': {
      'successes': {
        'expression': 'EventSpace=my_sample_space&Success=true'
      }
    }
  }
};
```

Now, set up the event with the required parameters.
The `space` property should reference the sample space created above.

